000041             05  PA-NOME-PRACA          PIC X(20).
000042             05  PA-SENTIDO             PIC X(01).
000043             05  FILLER                 PIC X(24).
000044         FD  EXTRATO
000045             RECORDING MODE IS F.
000046         01  REG-EXTRATO                PIC X(132).
