000139         PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000140         0000-PRINCIPAL.
000141             PERFORM 1000-INICIALIZAR THRU 1000-FIM-INICIALIZAR
000142             PERFORM 2000-PROCESSAR-TAG THRU 2000-FIM-PROCESSAR-TAG
000143                UNTIL WS-FS-APR-FIM
000144             PERFORM 3000-FINALIZAR THRU 3000-FIM-FINALIZAR
