000172         2000-PROCESSAR-TAG.
000173             MOVE PA-TAG TO WS-TAG-ANTERIOR
000174             MOVE ZERO   TO WS-TOTAL-TAG
000175             MOVE ZERO   TO WS-PASSAGENS-TAG
000176             ADD 1       TO WS-QTD-TAGS
000177             PERFORM 2100-PROCESSAR-PASSAGEM
000178                THRU 2100-FIM-PROCESSAR-PASSAGEM
000179                UNTIL WS-FS-APR-FIM
000180                   OR PA-TAG NOT = WS-TAG-ANTERIOR
000181             PERFORM 2200-IMPRIMIR-TOTAL-TAG
000182                THRU 2200-FIM-IMPRIMIR-TOTAL-TAG.
000183         2000-FIM-PROCESSAR-TAG.
000184             EXIT.
000185
000186         2100-PROCESSAR-PASSAGEM.
