000189
000190             MOVE PA-TAG             TO WS-TAG-ABERTA
000191             PERFORM 9800-MASCARAR-TAG THRU 9800-FIM-MASCARAR-TAG
000192             MOVE WS-TAG-MASC        TO DT-TAG
000193             MOVE PA-DATA            TO DT-DATA
000194             MOVE PA-HORA            TO WS-HORA-AUX
000195             MOVE WS-HH              TO DT-HH
