000198             MOVE PA-NOME-PRACA      TO DT-PRACA
000199             MOVE PA-CATEGORIA       TO DT-CATEGORIA
000200             MOVE PA-SENTIDO         TO DT-SENTIDO
000201             MOVE PA-VALOR           TO DT-VALOR
000202             IF PA-ISENTA
000203                MOVE 'ISENTA'        TO DT-OBS
000204             ELSE
000205                MOVE SPACES          TO DT-OBS
000206             END-IF
000207             PERFORM 7000-IMPRIMIR-DETALHE THRU 7000-FIM-IMPRIMIR-DETALHE
000208             PERFORM 8000-LER-APROVADA THRU 8000-FIM-LER-APROVADA.
